<title>INDIA: India 96/97 foodgrains output seen at 198.17 mln T.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 foodgrains output seen at 198.17 mln T.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's foodgrains output in 1996/97 (July-June) is estimated at 198.17 million tonnes compared to 185.04 million in the previous season, the Agriculture Ministry said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
